which is not a tropical cover since it does not satisfy the RH-condition at the
vertex $V$. As usual, we do not show edge lengths, end markings and vertex labelings in the picture. The
red numbers denote the genus of the vertices, the blue numbers the weights of the
edges.

\begin{figure}
