+NOTES = (
+    "Definition 2.2 fixes morphisms of tropical curves, including integral "
+    "slopes, balancing, Riemann-Hurwitz numbers and labels. Definitions 2.17 "
+    "and 2.19 define the cycle-closing equations and their lattice index. The "
+    "proof of Proposition 2.24 identifies every nonzero maximal minor whose "
+    "complement is a spanning tree with the product of the complementary edge "
+    "weights. Lemma 3.2 explains why these same lattice minors enter the local "
+    "branch-map multiplicity. Theorem 3.3 proves constancy of the branch-map "
